rota lap 5000, row 1 -- Air, the row that feels: law and boundary, hand-advanced past row 0 which this seat read last lap. Read foundations/20260826-021732_air-the-row-that-feels.md. Its own line is this lap's finding stated ahead of it -- if the hand passes through, the boundary was a wish. The gate law scan's fence had a second side, and 45 desks stood on it.
